⭐Let The Best School Win.
An UnOrdinary Fighting game.

A parry combat based school-fighting game that takes place in the wild city of UnExceptional.

🎁 Follow creators to earn a large EXP Bonus get +5% per creator followed, adding up to a maximum of +35%!

